---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Approach — HarvTech"
  description="How I work: contract engagements, security-first delivery, IaC standards."
>
  <section class="container-page py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Approach</p>
    <h1 class="title-display mb-6 hero-gradient max-w-3xl leading-tight">
      How I work.
    </h1>
    <p class="body-muted max-w-2xl text-lg">
      Long-form write-up coming soon. It'll cover the engagement model
      (outside IR35, day rate, notice periods), how I scope a piece of
      platform work, and the defaults I bring to a new client — IaC
      from day one, CI/CD without long-lived secrets, security findings
      triaged with reasoning rather than rubber-stamped.
    </p>
    <p class="body-muted mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm">
      In the meantime, see the
      <a href="/showcase" class="text-secondary hover:text-text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline">
        showcase
      </a> for what that looks like in practice, or
      <a href="mailto:alex@harvtech.co.uk" class="text-secondary hover:text-text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline">
        email me
      </a> directly.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
